{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Market Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754909567\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cunning dwarf wants to run an ancestral shop in the heart of the medieval world. Set deadly traps in dungeons to hunt down outcast warriors and loot their arcane goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.poster.avif?t=1754909567\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.webm?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/0c413aa18ba66700223cb82a8161623d.mp4?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack mystical chests and level up items. The more strategic your trap system, the more mystical chests you'll discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.poster.avif?t=1754909567\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.webm?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/66d94632249e8630cb73d36e5783d870.mp4?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 100 unique arcane items waiting to be sold in your shop. There are also various upgrade totems to increase your power and profit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816300?t=1754909567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/dc2a3b32d0333087e44ed62d99b299b3e6262e38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754909567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/4b9f468b898170cd9ead9edba8543441541ab4e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754909567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/4b9f468b898170cd9ead9edba8543441541ab4e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754909567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Market Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754909567\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754909567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s